Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:41:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] cli: decklink-test and decklink-bench

decklink-test shows 75 % bars (or a --project / --demo frame at
--seconds) on DeckLink device 0 for --hold seconds and fails if the card
refuses it: a check of the card and TV without the desktop app.

decklink-bench times External Video Output's stages over --frames frames:
CPU render, GPU composite + read-back, UYVY conversion and (unless
--no-card) 25 fps output on the card.
